# The hermetic pattern list is append-only and every branch appends to its end, so two branches
# adding a test collide on the last line even though neither read the other's. The union driver
# keeps both sides' lines instead of asking. Duplicates that come out of it are harmless:
# scripts/run-tests.sh dedupes the resolved file list before it runs anything.
tests/hermetic.patterns merge=union
